 #readme file# TechBridge Intern 
 #Management Platform# techbridge-task-1
## 📌 Project Overview
This project is the Final Capstone (Task 
8) for the TechBridge Web Development 
Internship. It is a full-stack Task 
Management System designed to track intern 
progress, manage weekly tasks, and display 
coding challenges.
## 🚀 Live Deployments
* **Frontend Dashboard (Vercel):** 
https://techbridge-task-1-s56l.vercel.app/dashboard.html 
* **Backend REST API (Render):** 
https://techbridge-api-pok9.onrender.com/api/tasks
## 🛠️ Technology Stack
* **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla 
JavaScript (DOM Manipulation, Fetch API) * 
**Backend:** Python 3, Flask, Flask-CORS * 
**Hosting:** Vercel (Edge Network) & 
Render (Web Service)
## ✨ Key Features
1. **Dynamic API Integration:** Frontend 
asynchronously fetches task data from a 
live Python/Flask backend. 2. **Real-Time 
Task Filtering:** Users can filter tasks 
by status (Completed, In Progress, Not 
Started). 3. **Live Search 
Functionality:** Search bar filters tasks 
instantly by keyword. 4. **Loading & Error 
States:** Provides visual feedback while 
the API fetches data or if the server goes 
offline.
# TechBridge Intern Management Platform

## 📌 Project Overview
This project is the Final Capstone (Task 8) for the TechBridge Web Development Internship. It is a full-stack Task Management System designed to track intern progress, manage weekly tasks, and display coding challenges. 

## 🚀 Live Deployments
* **Frontend Dashboard (Vercel):** https://techbridge-task-1-s56l.vercel.app/dashboard.html
* **Backend REST API (Render):** https://techbridge-api-pok9.onrender.com/api/tasks

## 🛠️ Technology Stack
* **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3, Vanilla JavaScript (DOM Manipulation, Fetch API)
* **Backend:** Python 3, Flask, Flask-CORS
* **Hosting:** Vercel (Edge Network) & Render (Web Service)

## ✨ Key Features
1. **Dynamic API Integration:** Frontend asynchronously fetches task data from a live Python/Flask backend.
2. **Real-Time Task Filtering:** Users can filter tasks by status (Completed, In Progress, Not Started).
3. **Live Search Functionality:** Search bar filters tasks instantly by keyword.
4. **Loading & Error States:** Provides visual feedback while the API fetches data or if the server goes offline.
